msgstr "已有伺服器"

msgid "Another tunnel already uses the name %s"
msgstr "已有通道使用名稱 %s"

msgid "Anything still serving it will keep the copy it already has until it restarts."
msgstr "仍在使用它的服務會繼續用手上那份，直到重新啟動為止。"

