msgstr "所有權的驗證方式。HTTP 需要網域已指向此處；泛網域必須用 DNS。"

msgid "If the ACL file was just installed, rpcd needs a restart: /etc/init.d/rpcd restart"
msgstr "如果 ACL 檔案是剛安裝的，需要重新啟動 rpcd：/etc/init.d/rpcd restart"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "部署"

