msgstr "來自訪客方向，單位 KB/s。0 表示不限。"

msgid "Kilobytes per second toward visitors. 0 for no limit."
msgstr "發往訪客方向，單位 KB/s。0 表示不限。"

msgid "Leave empty to let the server allocate one."
msgstr "留空則由伺服器自動分配。"

msgid "Leave unset to prove the name by serving a file, which the tunnel server answers for you."
msgstr "留空則透過提供一個檔案來證明網域歸屬，由穿透伺服器代為回應。"

