msgstr "無法取得工作狀態：%s"

msgid "Manages records and proves ownership when issuing certificates. Wildcards need one."
msgstr "用於管理解析記錄、以及簽發憑證時驗證所有權。泛網域必須設定。"

msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手動"

msgid "Megabytes in total, both directions. The tunnel stops accepting connections once reached. 0 for no cap."
msgstr "雙向合計，單位 MB。達到後隧道停止接受新連線。0 表示不限。"

