msgid "Name"
msgstr "名稱"

msgid "Names under the domain"
msgstr "域名下的名稱"

msgid "No DNS account configured. Wildcards need one — add it on the DNS page."
msgstr "未設定 DNS 帳戶。泛網域需要它——請先在 DNS 頁面新增。"

msgid "No DNS accounts yet. Add one to manage records and to issue wildcard certificates."
msgstr "還沒有 DNS 帳號。新增一個即可管理解析記錄並簽發泛網域憑證。"

