msgstr "只能是一段：字母、數字和短橫線。"

msgid "One per line. \"*\" covers one level only: *.aiqno.com, not a.b.aiqno.com."
msgstr "每行一個。\"*\" 只涵蓋一級：*.aiqno.com 不含 a.b.aiqno.com。"

msgid "Only certificates covering every domain are listed. Pushed without dropping connections."
msgstr "僅列出涵蓋全部網域的憑證。推送時不會中斷連線。"

