msgstr "哪一端處理 HTTPS，憑證就歸哪一端。伺服端用的憑證在此簽發並推送過去。"

msgid "Without it the local service records every visitor as this router. Configure the service first, or every request fails.\n\nnginx:\n    listen PORT proxy_protocol;\n    set_real_ip_from THIS-ROUTER-LAN-ADDRESS;\n    real_ip_header proxy_protocol;"
msgstr "不啟用時，內網服務會把每個訪客都記成本路由器。請先設定好服務，否則所有請求都會失敗。\n\nnginx：\n    listen PORT proxy_protocol;\n    set_real_ip_from THIS-ROUTER-LAN-ADDRESS;\n    real_ip_header proxy_protocol;"

